{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houzhu-e-o037a","title":"蒋琬屯驻汉中","accounts":[{"id":"houzhu-a-4a6e0723c69e","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"冬十一月，大将军蒋琬出屯汉中。","evidence":["houzhu-q-O037"]},{"id":"jfj-a-o009a","label":"正文 · 延熙元年","text":"诏蒋琬统军屯汉中以待吴军行动","evidence":["jfj-q0053"]}],"participants":[{"person":"guanzhang-p0047","role":"驻屯者","evidence":["houzhu-q-O037"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"冬十一月","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条原纪年表达；没有直接绑定的公元年证据，未补公元年。","evidence":["houzhu-q-O037"]},"ordering_evidence":"houzhu-q-O037","source_order":[33,37,"O037a"],"order":6653}],"persons":[{"id":"guanzhang-p0047","name":"蒋琬","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O037","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-79560f7280494840e1ce","layer":"original","quote":"冬十一月，大将军蒋琬出屯汉中。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0053","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-b05d0c43e6bb97a4e137","layer":"original","quote":"延熙元年，诏琬曰：“寇难未弭，曹叡骄凶；辽东三郡苦其暴虐〖6〗，遂相纠结，与之离隔。叡大兴众役，还相攻伐。曩秦之亡〖7〗，胜、广首难〖8〗；今有此变，斯乃天时。君其治严〖9〗，总帅诸军，屯住汉中；须吴举动〖10〗，东西掎角〖11〗，以乘其衅。”又命琬开府。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
